agents-orchestrator release v7.15.0 (tag v7.15.0, commit c0c77e484747cc01327fcd51db2b327641d67d62, T-120 slice 2 superleader reads), /agent/v1 paths only (method, operationId and, when the operation declares any, its query parameter names). Re-vendored from its openapi.json: for each path starting with /agent/v1 write {"paths": {path: {method: {"operationId": id, "query": [sorted query parameter names, omitted when none]}}}} with sorted keys and indent 1. Relay routes without declared parameters (usage history and sessions, projects summary) carry no query list.
